Now write game.js. This will be long, maybe 1800 lines. Need be careful with syntax.

Let's outline code sections:

```
(function(){
 const LT = window.LT;
 const U=LT.util, A=LT.art, D=LT.data, SAVE=LT.save, AUDIO=LT.audio;
 const $=(id)=>document.getElementById(id);
 const stage=..., ctx=...
 const view={w:0,h:0,dpr:1};
 const state={ mode:'title', S:null, ...}
 ...
})();
```

